record.description:
So we used to have a tutorial pop up when mini games are unlocked. It's no longer there. Now that we unlock memory and river tile game after chapter 2 level 6, can we show a tutorial on the saga map again where it said something like "You've unlocked mini games!"

@Leonard said:

> Show a pop-up screen after chapter 2 level 6 (mini-game unlocked) that pop-up goes away when player either hit the x button. The pop-up has 2 options, play mini-games OR stay. Hitting X is the same as “stay”
